<p>Chinese President Xi Jinping met Russian Foreign Minister Sergey Lavrov in Beijing on April 15 and said China and Russia should deepen “all-round cooperation,” describing their relationship as a source of stability and certainty during a period of international “changes and chaos”. The meeting came as Beijing hosted several foreign leaders this week, and as the war involving Iran pushed Middle East diplomacy and energy security higher up the agenda. Xi also pointed to a broader diplomatic role for China, telling other visiting leaders that Beijing would play a “constructive role” in promoting peace talks in the Middle East while calling for stronger cooperation and support for the authority of the United Nations. For readers following world affairs, the immediate takeaway is that China is presenting itself both as a close strategic partner of Russia and as a potential mediator as conflict-driven instability spills into trade and energy concerns.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/QAgvaZCa6JtzUuKaZht3u_xdgdMyHgm6s02eFbPZrLB8Kfz_efDa7KQnwHLVrFgMmvJS3ir5Hdyz-n3OodIHZ1QKlJ2QRPxUTvmgfw5Bi-J7' alt='Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russia’s Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov shake hands at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing, China on April 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Leader visits: Lavrov&#x27;s trip to Beijing coincided with visits by Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez, Abu Dhabi Crown Prince Mohamed bin Zayed Al Nahyan, and Vietnamese President To Lam, showing how the Middle East war drew several affected governments into Beijing diplomacy at the same time.</li><li>Energy offer: After meeting Xi, Lavrov said Moscow could “compensate” for China&#x27;s energy shortages while shipping through the Strait of Hormuz remains constrained by the Iran war.</li><li>Geographic logic: Xi said the two countries should make full use of their “geographic proximity and complementarity” to strengthen development resilience, framing cooperation in practical as well as strategic terms.</li></ul><blockquote>Both sides should maintain strategic focus, trust each other, support each other, develop together - Xi Jinping</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Xi Jinping: Xi said the friendship treaty between China and Russia shows “strong vitality and exemplary significance” in the current moment, underscoring the partnership&#x27;s institutional depth rather than only its short-term tactical value. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/xi-jinping-calls-china-russia-ties-precious-in-current-international-context/article70864441.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>Pedro Sanchez: Spain&#x27;s prime minister welcomed China&#x27;s role in seeking a resolution to the Middle East conflict during his talks with Xi in Beijing. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Dylan Loh: The Singapore-based academic said Beijing&#x27;s level of diplomatic activity is normal, but the Middle East war has made energy security a more urgent part of current discussions. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3350167/strong-china-russia-relations-are-stabilising-force-turbulent-landscape-xi-jinping'>Strong China-Russia relations are stabilising force in a ‘turbulent’ landscape: Xi Jinping</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/xi-hails-china-russia-ties-signals-bigger-role-in-iran-war/a-76787130'>Xi hails China-Russia ties, signals bigger role in Iran war</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991931/xi-meets-russian-fm-as-leaders-flock-to-china-over-middle-east-war'>Xi meets Russian FM as leaders flock to China over Middle East war</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/xi-calls-china-russia-ties-precious-current-international-132050372'>Xi calls China-Russia ties &#x27;precious&#x27; in current international context</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/xi-jinping-calls-china-russia-ties-precious-in-current-international-context/article70864441.ece'>Xi Jinping calls China-Russia ties &#x27;precious&#x27; in current international context</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>